<title>USA: Connie Lee has insurance for NYS Med Care/Dorms.</title>
<headline>Connie Lee has insurance for NYS Med Care/Dorms.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Connie Lee Insurance Co said it has limited secondary market insurance capacity for New York State Medical Care/Dormitory Authority--Mental Health Facilities. Minimum maturity is 20 years and minimum size is a $1 million block. Capacity is on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>
<p>For more information, call Larry Weiss at (202) 728-3436 or (800) 877-5333.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
